# Mabel, Heir to Cragflame: the enters trigger creates one Cragflame, not more. Donatello, Way with Machines puts a +1/+1 counter
# on itself whenever an artifact Bot1 controls enters. With Donatello in play Bot1 casts Mabel ({1}{R}{W}) off Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl
# and Mox Jet: the one Cragflame entering adds exactly one counter. (Two tokens would add two, the legend rule then putting one
# into the graveyard.)

